cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If cie helps your work, a citation is appreciated."
title: "cie — Code Insight Engine"
abstract: >-
  A pluggable, language-agnostic code graph that an LLM coding agent can
  actually use. Index a project and serve symbol search, call-graph
  traversal, and file skeletons to Claude Code, Cursor, or any MCP client.
  For teams on Neo4j, cie adds task/QA traceability and continuous
  quality-governance over the live graph.
authors:
